      "text": "5) as the interviewer clicks the start interview button the request is\nsend and after entire logic of authentication socket send successfull\nresponse.\nsocket:{\nnamespace : \"INTERVIEW\",\nevent:\"INTERVIEW_START\",\npayload:{\nroom:{\npariticipants:[]\nstatus:LIVE\n}}}\nthen the page navigates to the\nnavigate(\"/interview/interviewId/room/workspace\")\nAnd this now further leads to achiev the \n1) Workspace fetch and setup\n2) Video feed Setup\n3)terminal setup if required.\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5) as the interviewer clicks the start interview button the request is send and after entire logic of authentication socket send successfull response.\nsocket:{\nnamespace : \"INTERVIEW\",\nevent:\"INTERVIEW_START\",\npayload:{\nroom:{\npariticipants:[]\nstatus:LIVE\n}}}\nthen the page navigates to the navigate(\"/interview/interviewId/room/workspace\")\nAnd this now further leads to achiev the \n1) Workspace fetch and setup\n2) Video feed Setup\n3)terminal setup if required.\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
